. Globalists get fucked!</p>\n<p>NO BRAKES!!!</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 17, "score_up": 16, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATomzHOlf", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 17, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "hunter", "id": 8951423, "raw_content": "", "author": "TheRedPilledArtist", "created": 1795398169628, "profile_picture": "AXnYRxvvQRHa", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Farmcatarmy", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATomzHOlf.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/8e18Kp7PXIIh.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/CuMtg4xwXFCbVMCC.jpeg", "width": 550, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 768}], "blurhash": "UUE{X@js?vof4.j[ITay00t7M{ay~pV@%Mj[", "full_resolution": [1130, 809]}, "title": "Georgia mother \ud835\udde7\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddfb\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddf6\ud835\uddf8\ud835\uddee \ud835\udddf\ud835\uddee\ud835\ude00\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddf2 \ud835\udde6\ud835\uddf6\ud835\uddff\ud835\uddfa\ud835\uddee\ud835\uddfb\ud835\ude00, 37, has been charged with TWO counts of SECOND-DEGREE MURDER after her two young sons DIED in a house fire while allegedly left home alone as she went to work...", "last_comment_created": 1795398825649, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 3, "score_up": 17, "is_edited": false, "is_mod